+    evidence.push_str("\nChoose a change that addresses the user's request and diagnostics. For edit, copy a unique block from this current file and provide different replacement text. Do not rename unrelated symbols to silence an error. If the desired text already exists, verify the remaining problem instead of editing it again. If no justified correction is available, report the blocker.");
